  "description": "Replacement of the roof covering with CUPA 12 natural slates.\n\nReplacement of the existing single glazed sash windows to the front elevation of the property with\nnew timber framed double glazed replacement windows, matching the original style. The\nreplacement windows are to be painted white and will replicate the detailing of the original windows\nin terms of the glazing pattern, fenestration, and frame. Sash handles to be retained and reused\nwhere existing. Please refer to elevation drawings.\n\nReplacement of existing sash and casement windows to the rear of the property with new UPVC\nframed double glazed replacements where not visible to the public realm. Where rear/side\nwindows are visible to the public realm they will be replaced as white painted timber. Please refer\nto elevation drawings.\n\nReplacement of rear doors with new UPVC double glazed replacements. Please refer to elevation drawings.\n\nWindow surround repair where required painted to match existing. Masonry repair with reclaimed\nLondon Stock Bricks and lime mortar to match existing.",
